:null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"josephzidell","id":1812443,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MTI0NDM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1812443?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/josephzidell","html_url":"https://github.com/josephzidell","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/josephzidell/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/josephzidell/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/josephzidell/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/josephzidell/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/josephzidell/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/josephzidell/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/josephzidell/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/josephzidell/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/josephzidell/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/comments/188109062","html_url":"https://github.com/cakephp/cakephp/issues/3407#issuecomment-188109062","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/3407","id":188109062,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDE4ODEwOTA2Mg==","user":{"login":"trenshaw","id":8139507,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMzk1MDc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8139507?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/trenshaw","html_url":"https://github.com/trenshaw","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trenshaw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trenshaw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trenshaw/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trenshaw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trenshaw/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trenshaw/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trenshaw/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trenshaw/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trenshaw/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2016-02-24T06:56:15Z","updated_at":"2016-02-24T06:56:15Z","body":"If you want to do a 'threaded' find with conditions and only have those conditions apply to parents you could overload Model::find for $type = 'threaded' in the model where you need it. For example:-\n\n```\n    public function find($type, $queryData = array()) {\n        switch ($type) {\n            case 'threaded' :\n                $results = parent::find('all', $queryData);\n\n                foreach($results as &$r) {\n                    $r['children'] = $this->find('all', array(\n                            'conditions' => array('parent_id' => $r[$this->alias][$this->primaryKey])\n                    ));\n                }\n                return $results;\n\n            default:\n                return parent::find($type, $queryData);\n        }\n    }\n```\n\nI use this overload in CakePHP 1.3.x. I have not tested it in CakePHP 2.x or later.\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/comments/188109062/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"trenshaw","id":8139507,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMzk1MDc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8139507?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/trenshaw","html_url":"https://github.com/trenshaw","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trenshaw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trenshaw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trenshaw/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trenshaw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trenshaw/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trenshaw/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trenshaw/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trenshaw/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trenshaw/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/comments/188133271","html_url":"https://github.com/cakephp/cakephp/issues/3407#issuecomment-188133271","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/3407","id":188133271,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDE4ODEzMzI3MQ==","user":{"login":"trenshaw","id":8139507,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMzk1MDc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8139507?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/trenshaw","html_url":"https://github.com/trenshaw","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trenshaw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trenshaw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trenshaw/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trenshaw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trenshaw/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trenshaw/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trenshaw/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trenshaw/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trenshaw/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2016-02-24T08:08:34Z","updated_at":"2016-02-24T08:08:34Z","body":"And if you want this to mimic the original 'threaded' behavior i.e. exclude children in find result except where 'parent_id' has been specified then modify your $queryData in parent::find. For example:-\n\n```\n$results = parent::find('all', array_replace_recursive(array('conditions' => array('parent_id' => null)), $queryData));\n```\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/comments/188133271/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"trenshaw","id":8139507,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMzk1MDc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8139507?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/trenshaw","html_url":"https://github.com/trenshaw","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trenshaw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trenshaw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trenshaw/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trenshaw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trenshaw/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trenshaw/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trenshaw/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trenshaw/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trenshaw/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/comments/1123075643","html_url":"https://github.com/cakephp/cakephp/issues/3407#issuecomment-1123075643","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/3407","id":1123075643,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAAoEbs5C8MY7","user":{"login":"wsergent","id":7488024,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0ODgwMjQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7488024?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wsergent","html_url":"https://github.com/wsergent","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wsergent/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wsergent/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wsergent/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wsergent/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wsergent/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wsergent/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wsergent/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wsergent/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wsergent/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2022-05-11T01:17:58Z","updated_at":"2022-05-11T01:17:58Z","body":"Years later, and I've had to visit this page working on an old piece of code in Cake 2.1.5 where we need a threaded find, passing a parent_id (i.e. we want to grab an item and ALL of it's children).\r\n@trenshaw's solution above worked fine, but I needed to replace the 'all' in his foreach() with 'threaded' to ensure that each of the children returned their own trees - otherwise using this method would return only the requested parent and it's immediate children, rather than the whole tree structure.\r\n\r\nUpdated code below:\r\n\r\n```\r\n    public function find($type = 'first', $queryData = []) {\r\n        switch ($type) {\r\n            case 'threaded' :\r\n                $results = parent::find('all', $queryData);\r\n\r\n                foreach($results as &$r) {\r\n                    $r['children'] = $this->find('threaded', [\r\n                        'conditions' => [\r\n                            'parent_id' => $r[$this->alias][$this->primaryKey]\r\n                        ]\r\n                    ]);\r\n                }\r\n                return $results;\r\n\r\n            default:\r\n                return parent::find($type, $queryData);\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n```\r\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/comments/1123075643/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"h